    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. so if that's the case, doesn't that mean the most \"pro-innovation\" thing a government can actually do is just minimize its footprint in the tech space? if the goal is growth, wouldn't a hands-off, laissez-faire approach be the objectively better path for a developing economy?",
